urchased loans, as well as other loans. Further, the company offers online and internet banking, mobile banking, and remote deposits. The company was formerly known as Central Federal Corporation and changed its name to CF Bankshares Inc. in July 2020. CF Bankshares Inc. was founded in 1892 and is headquartered in Columbus, Ohio."}}